0..71 Comment "//! `natural` compares a region-polymorphic function across a widening."
72..75 Comment "//!"
76..154 Comment "//! A view at an outer region stands at an inner region. The pathological twin"
155..216 Comment "//! refuses a reversed widening as `TypeMismatch`. It refuses"
217..241 Comment "//! unequal functions as"
242..265 Comment "//! `EndpointMismatch`."
266..269 Comment "//!"
270..347 Comment "//! The checker verifies each square by conversion. Both examples run to `5`."
348..351 Comment "//!"
352..411 Comment "//! - owes: #2139 — a value type that quantifies a region"
412..484 Comment "//! - see: corpus/pathological/regions/natural.gandr — invalid squares"
486..532 Comment "// `pass` returns a thunk in its input region."
